      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: ilhan_omar_linda_sarsour_rashida_tlaib_ocasto-cortez_meme; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The meme presents three Muslim women politicians (Ilhan Omar, Linda Sarsour, Rashida Tlaib, and Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez) with the text 'the enemy has infiltrated congress the enemy within,' implying they are traitors or foreign agents. This is a hateful attack targeting Muslim women in political office, using the 'foreign infiltrator' trope associated with anti-Asian and Islamophobic stereotypes to delegitimize their political roles and suggest they are disloyal to the United States. The juxtaposition of their images with this accusatory text is designed to incite hostility and distrust toward them based on their religion and gender, fitting the definition of a hateful meme.",
